    {comment}
      The block set and the dispatch are the PLATFORM's, shipped by the Content
      module -- this theme carries neither. Overriding a single block means
      adding `partials/blocks/<type>.html.dtmpl` here; the theme's loader
      outranks the module's, so that file wins and the other twelve still
      resolve to the shared ones.
    {endcomment}
